elin third, another 1m38s behind.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":46,"text":"Czaykowski wins the 1500cc class with 44 laps; Simons (DKW) the 1100cc class with 38.","q":false,"c":3},{"lap":46,"text":"Despite of the situation Chiron decided to push during the last lap and made the fastest lap of the race with a time of 3m12s (121.5 km/h)","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":46,"text":"Chiron wins; von Morgen second, 5 1/2 minutes later; Etancelin third, another 1m38s behind.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":46,"text":"Czaykowski wins the 1500cc class with 44 laps; Simons (DKW) the 1100cc class with 38.","q":false,"c":3}]}